flowchart TB
  subgraph ROW1["01 · REQUEST · FRONTEND / AUTH / API"]
    direction LR
    UI["Frontend · React / TypeScript / Vite<br/>Bearer-token REST client"]
    COG["Cognito User Pool · OAuth<br/>Authorization code · tickets scope"]
    API["API Gateway REST API<br/>Cognito authorizer · scope validation<br/>Ticket CRUD · status · audit · admin DLQ"]
    IDEM["Idempotency Lambda<br/>DynamoDB claim<br/>Accepted ticket writes → SQS"]
    READ["Read Lambda<br/>DynamoDB ticket/status/audit reads<br/>Admin DLQ inspection"]
    UI -->|Sign in| COG
    COG ~~~ API
    API -->|Write routes| IDEM
    API -->|Read routes| READ
  end

  subgraph ROW2["02 · ASYNC PROCESSING · QUEUE / STORAGE / NOTIFICATIONS"]
    direction LR
    SQS["SQS FIFO · Writes queue"]
    DLQ["SQS FIFO Dead-Letter Queue<br/>Redrive after 3 failed receives"]
    WRITE["Write Lambda · SQS consumer<br/>Transactional DynamoDB writes"]
    DDB[("DynamoDB · Tickets · Idempotency<br/>Audit · Notifications outbox")]
    EVENT["EventBridge<br/>Rate: 1 minute"]
    WORKER["Notification Worker Lambda<br/>Query/update outbox · publish to SNS"]
    SNS["SNS alerts topic<br/>Admin email subscription"]

    SQS -->|3 failed receives| DLQ
    SQS -->|Event source mapping| WRITE
    WRITE -->|Transactional ticket · operation · audit · outbox writes| DDB
    EVENT -->|Scheduled invoke · every minute| WORKER
    DDB -->|Notification outbox| WORKER
    WORKER -->|Publish| SNS
  end

  subgraph ROW3["03 · MONITORING · OPERATIONS"]
    direction LR
    LOGS["CloudWatch Logs · API access · Lambda"]
    METRICS["CloudWatch Metrics<br/>API · Lambda · SQS · DynamoDB<br/>TechAssist/Notifications custom metric"]
    DASH["Dashboard · 5 widgets<br/>API Lambda: invocations/errors/duration<br/>Writes + DLQ · Tickets R/W capacity<br/>Worker invocations/errors/duration · API 4XX/5XX"]
    ALARMS["CloudWatch Alarms · 7 alarms / 6 categories<br/>Actions → SNS"]
    BUDGET["AWS Budgets<br/>Monthly actual-cost email alerts"]
    METRICS -->|Dashboard data| DASH
    METRICS -->|Alarm evaluation| ALARMS
    LOGS ~~~ METRICS
    METRICS ~~~ DASH
    DASH ~~~ ALARMS
    ALARMS ~~~ BUDGET
  end

  ROW1 ~~~ ROW2
  ROW2 ~~~ ROW3

